# ScriptPlayerActor: Torvus Bog 00_pickup_swamp_c (3dfd2249) layer 0: e0042008f "PlayerActor Samus"
# (flags 0x404: 0x400 = no suit re-check in Think). Activate, beam change while loaded, Deactivate.
@f300 god 1; give darkBeam 1; give lightBeam 1
@f320 obj e0042008f
@f340 send e0042008f Activate
@f700 beam dark
@f760 obj e0042008f
@f900 send e0042008f Deactivate
@f920 send e0042008f Activate
@f1300 send e0042008f Delete
